flowchart LR
    A[Scene from Scene JSON] --> B{Scene type}
    B -- Image or graphics --> C[Make still or graphic]
    C --> H[Animate and add to timeline]
    B -- AI video --> D{AI budget left?}
    D -- No --> F[Fallback to animated image]
    D -- Yes --> E[Generate clip]
    E --> G{QC passed?}
    G -- Yes --> H
    G -- No --> I{Attempts left?}
    I -- Yes --> D
    I -- No --> F
    F --> H
